  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 28 October 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nEnjoy space, sunshine and an exceptional coastal lifestyle at 2/52 Aberdeen Road, Campbells Bay.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 250m² of floor area, this sun-filled family home features 4 bedrooms, a study, 3 bathrooms and 2 living areas. Designed to make the most of its position, the home enjoys excellent all-day sun, while the generous yard provides plenty of outdoor space for children, pets, entertaining or simply relaxing in the sunshine.\r\n\r\nBeautiful sea views and a peaceful reserve outlook enhance the sense of space and openness. The lower level combines a bedroom with an additional living space, providing extra flexibility for teenagers, guests or extended family.\r\n\r\nLocation is another key advantage. Campbells Bay School is within easy walking distance, and the property is zoned for sought-after North Shore schools including Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls' High School.\r\n\r\nAn active coastal lifestyle is right on your doorstep, with tennis courts, a golf course and football grounds all within walking distance. Campbells Bay Beach, Castor Bay Beach, Kennedy Park, local reserves and coastal walks are also close by, offering plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nEveryday convenience is equally impressive. A bus stop right outside makes getting around easy, while Mairangi Bay Village and the popular Milford shopping and lifestyle precinct are both within easy reach, offering supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, shopping and everyday essentials.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• Approximately 250m² of generous living\r\n• 4 bedrooms + study\r\n• 3 bathrooms and 2 living areas\r\n• Excellent all-day sun\r\n• Generous yard with plenty of outdoor space\r\n• Sea views and reserve outlook\r\n• Walk to Campbells Bay School\r\n• Sought-after North Shore school zones\r\n• Tennis courts, golf course and football grounds within walking distance\r\n• Close to Campbells Bay Beach, Castor Bay Beach & Kennedy Park\r\n• Bus stop right outside\r\n• Easy access to Mairangi Bay Village & Milford\r\n\r\nSea views, all-day sun, a generous yard and an outstanding coastal location – everything a family needs in the heart of Campbells Bay.",
